  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard\" style=\"width:22em; font-size:88%;\"><tbody><tr class=\"adr\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\" class=\"mergedtoprow\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.25em 0.33em 0.33em;line-height:1.2em;font-size:1.25em;\"><span class=\"fn org country-name\">Association of Trans-Siberia</span><br /></th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n          <td class=\"maptable\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.5em 0;\"><table style=\"text-align:center;width:100%;background:none;\"><tbody><tr>\n                <td style=\"text-align:center;width:58%; vertical-align:middle;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/b5/Trans-siberia.png/revision/latest?cb=20170817223636\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of Trans-Siberia\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/b5/Trans-siberia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20170817223636\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"83\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Trans-siberia.png\" data-image-key=\"Trans-siberia.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:center;width:auto;vertical-align:middle;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/01/Siberia_CoA.png/revision/latest?cb=20170911201821\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Coat of arms of Trans-Siberia\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/01/Siberia_CoA.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/85?cb=20170911201821\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Siberia CoA.png\" data-image-key=\"Siberia_CoA.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td>\n              </tr><tr>\n              <td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:85%;\">Flag</td>\n              <td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:85%;\">Coat of arms</td>\n              </tr></tbody></table>\n          </td>\n        </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b></td><td>Vladivostok</td></tr>\n             <tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n               <th colspan=\"2\">Largest city</th>\n               <td>Irkutsk</td></tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">Official languages</th>\n         <td>English, Russian</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\">Government</th>\n         <td>Federal presidential constitutional republic</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">President</td>\n         <td>Vlad Psakhis</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Vice President</td>\n         <td>Ben Makarov</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\">Legislature</th>\n         <td>National Duma</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Upper_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Upper house\">Upper house</a></td>\n         <td>High Senate</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Lower house\">Lower house</a></td>\n         <td>State Duma</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><th colspan=\"3\">Unification</th></tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Founded</td>\n         <td>October 16, 2141&#160;</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\">Population</th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n            <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n            <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">2160&#160;estimate</td>\n            <td>&gt;84 million</td>\n          </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">Currency</th>\n           <td>United States Dollar ($) (<a href=\"/wiki/ISO_4217\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISO 4217\">USD</a>)</td>\n       </tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Trans-Siberia is a <a href=\"/wiki/Associated_state\" title=\"Associated state\">free association</a> formed from the Asian parts of Russia.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTrans-Siberia%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>TBA\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119081739\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 527/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7525/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 753/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser fu